  Description: As an apprentice, you practiced a particular form of building or crafting,
    developing a specialized skill. You might have been a blacksmith's apprentice
    toiling over the forge for countless hours, a young tailor sewing garments of
    all kinds, or a shipwright shaping the hulls of ships. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Strength or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Crafting skill and the Guild Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Specialty
    Crafting] skill feat.
